flowchart TD
 Source[Source and lockfiles] --> Composer[composer install --no-dev]
 Source --> Npm[npm ci]
 Npm --> Build[npm run build]
 Composer --> Artifact[Release artifact]
 Build --> Artifact
 Artifact --> Env[Protected production environment]
 Env --> Backup[Backup database and required media]
 Backup --> Deploy[Deploy with web root = public/]
 Deploy --> Migrate[php artisan migrate --force]
 Migrate --> Restart[Restart PHP and supervised workers]
 Restart --> Verify[Health, auth, mail, DB and enabled workflows]
 Verify --> Live[Release accepted]
